 ty\, USA\nVenue: Calvin L. Rampton Salt Palace Convention Center\n\nAll da
 tes:\n  Paper and panel proposal submission: 24 Jul 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (a
 ssumed)\n  Notification of acceptance: 1 Oct 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)
